  "statement": "For $a>1$, simplify $\\\\ln\\\\bigl(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1}\\\\bigr)-\\\\ln\\\\bigl(a-\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1}\\\\bigr)$.",
  "solution": "Note $(a-\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})=a^{2}-(a^{2}-1)=1$, so $a-\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1}=\\\\tfrac{1}{a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1}}$. Hence the expression is $\\\\ln(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})-\\\\ln\\\\bigl(\\\\tfrac{1}{a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1}}\\\\bigr)=\\\\ln(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})+\\\\ln(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})=2\\\\ln(a+\\\\sqrt{a^{2}-1})$.",
